{
  "id": "E156",
  "title": "Sharing the Beautiful Moon",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-10-04",
  "synopsis": "How do people celebrate the Mid-Autumn Festival nowadays?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/543/7b136cc600f684fac063c6c3ee17b7c70e500e6a.mp3?1507052184",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "千里共婵娟\n\n小明：保罗，你知道今天是什么日子吗？\n保罗：今天不是我的生日，也不是你的生日，没什么特别的呀。\n小明：今天是农历八月十五，中秋节！\n保罗：哦，我听说过中秋节，今天应该吃月饼。\n小明：对。除了吃月饼以外，我们还要赏月。\n保罗：可是今天上海是阴天，恐怕晚上看不到月亮。\n小明：别担心，我们可以在网上看月亮。\n保罗：怎么看？\n小明：人们拍了月亮的照片都会发到微博上，我们一刷微博，就能看到全国各地的月亮了。\n保罗：好主意！这就是中国人常说的“千里共婵娟”啊！",
    "traditional": "千里共嬋娟\n\n小明：保羅，你知道今天是什麼日子嗎？\n保羅：今天不是我的生日，也不是你的生日，沒什麼特別的呀。\n小明：今天是農曆八月十五，中秋節！\n保羅：哦，我聽說過中秋節，今天應該吃月餅。\n小明：對。除了吃月餅以外，我們還要賞月。\n保羅：可是今天上海是陰天，恐怕晚上看不到月亮。\n小明：別擔心，我們可以在網上看月亮。\n保羅：怎麼看？\n小明：人們拍了月亮的照片都會發到微博上，我們一刷微博，就能看到全國各地的月亮了。\n保羅：好主意！這就是中國人常說的“千里共嬋娟”啊！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Sharing the beautiful moon thousands of miles apart"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：保罗，你知道今天是什么日子吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：保羅，你知道今天是什麼日子嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bǎo luó nǐ zhī dào jīn tiān shì shén me rì zi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Paul, do you know what day it is today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：今天不是我的生日，也不是你的生日，没什么特别的呀。",
      "traditional": "保羅：今天不是我的生日，也不是你的生日，沒什麼特別的呀。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jīn tiān bú shì wǒ de shēng rì yě bú shì nǐ de shēng rì méi shén me tè bié de ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s not my birthday, and not your birthday either. It’s just an ordinary day."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：今天是农历八月十五，中秋节！",
      "traditional": "小明：今天是農曆八月十五，中秋節！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jīn tiān shì nóng lì bā yuè shí wǔ zhōng qiū jié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Today is August 15th according to the lunar calendar: the Mid-Autumn Festival!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：哦，我听说过中秋节，今天应该吃月饼。",
      "traditional": "保羅：哦，我聽說過中秋節，今天應該吃月餅。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó ò wǒ tīng shuō guò zhōng qiū jié jīn tiān yīng gāi chī yuè bǐng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Oh, I’ve heard about it. We should eat mooncakes today."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：对。除了吃月饼以外，我们还要赏月。",
      "traditional": "小明：對。除了吃月餅以外，我們還要賞月。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng duì chú le chī yuè bǐng yǐ wài wǒ men hái yào shǎng yuè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Exactly. In addition to eating mooncakes, we can admire the moon as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：可是今天上海是阴天，恐怕晚上看不到月亮。",
      "traditional": "保羅：可是今天上海是陰天，恐怕晚上看不到月亮。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó kě shì jīn tiān shàng hǎi shì yīn tiān kǒng pà wǎn shang kàn bu dào yuè liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: But it’s cloudy today in Shanghai, I’m afraid we cannot see the moon tonight."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：别担心，我们可以在网上看月亮。",
      "traditional": "小明：別擔心，我們可以在網上看月亮。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bié dān xīn wǒ men kě yǐ zài wǎng shang kàn yuè liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Don’t worry, we can watch the moon online."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：怎么看？",
      "traditional": "保羅：怎麼看？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zěn me kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明：人们拍了月亮的照片都会发到微博上，",
      "traditional": "小明：人們拍了月亮的照片都會發到微博上，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng rén men pāi le yuè liang de zhào piàn dōu huì fā dào wēi bó shang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "我们一刷微博，就能看到全国各地的月亮了。",
      "traditional": "我們一刷微博，就能看到全國各地的月亮了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men yì shuā wēi bó jiù néng kàn dào quán guó gè dì de yuè liang le",
      "english": "Little Ming: People will post their photos of the moon on Weibo."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "We just need to refresh our timeline and we can see the moon from all over China."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "保罗：好主意！这就是中国人常说的“千里共婵娟”啊！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好主意！這就是中國人常說的“千里共嬋娟”啊！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo zhǔ yi zhè jiù shì zhōng guó rén cháng shuō de qiān lǐ gòng chán juān a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Good idea! This is what Chinese people call “sharing the beautiful moon thousands of miles apart”!"
    }
  ],
