    "sentence_translations": [
      "Sharing the beautiful moon thousands of miles apart",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Paul, do you know what day it is today?",
      "",
      "Paul: It’s not my birthday, and not your birthday either. It’s just an ordinary day.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Today is August 15th according to the lunar calendar: the Mid-Autumn Festival!",
      "",
      "Paul: Oh, I’ve heard about it. We should eat mooncakes today.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Exactly. In addition to eating mooncakes, we can admire the moon as well.",
      "",
      "Paul: But it’s cloudy today in Shanghai, I’m afraid we cannot see the moon tonight.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Don’t worry, we can watch the moon online.",
      "",
      "Paul: How?",
      "",
      "Little Ming: People will post their photos of the moon on Weibo.",
      "We just need to refresh our timeline and we can see the moon from all over China.",
      "",
      "Paul: Good idea! This is what Chinese people call “sharing the beautiful moon thousands of miles apart”!",
      ""
    ]
  }
